# inference: Terraform AWS EKS Karpenter template

## Project organization

This project provisions a base AWS EKS cluster intended as the foundation for inference
workloads. It uses Terraform as the infrastructure-as-code engine and relies on
[Karpenter](https://karpenter.sh) for node autoscaling over self-managed nodes.

The template deploys:
- A VPC with public and private subnets
- An EKS cluster
- Karpenter, with NodePools/EC2NodeClasses that provision self-managed nodes on demand

